Now you've been seeing me make some of these numbers as cubes here with wooden blocks. If I had more of them,

00:03:56.319 --> 00:03:58.319
like a lot more of them,

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:02.720
what if I was to make that big number that I just showed you for the number 3?

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.480
I'm gonna need a lot more of them.

